@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName PT Sans
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam shadowing false
title Project control — границы authority
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Checkout: слабая сторона" {
  rectangle "Code / ordinary data" as Data
  rectangle "Candidate context / skill / MCP\nProject permission bytes — inert requests" as Candidate
}
rectangle "Protected manager state" {
  rectangle "Operator policy / immutable denies\nAgent grants внутри ceiling" as Policy
  rectangle "Approved digest + project identity\nComposition + leases" as Approval
  Policy -down-> Approval : ограничивает admission
}
rectangle "Qualified runtime boundary" {
  rectangle "Generated protected copies\nProfile root + approved project layer" as Copies
  rectangle "Harness policy: default deny\nNative memory off; source exclusion" as Harness
  Copies -down-> Harness
}
Candidate -down-> Approval : inspect / audit / approve
Approval -down-> Copies : verify before delivery / start
Data ..> Harness : рабочие данные через tools
rectangle "OS / trusted execution provider\nОтдельная граница исполнения" as OS
Harness -down-> OS : реальное действие
legend bottom
  Project-aware design ⟦решено⟧; qualification обязательна.
  Repository bytes не создают approval или permission grant.
  Managed home сам по себе не является OS sandbox.
endlegend
@enduml
